claims:
12. A method of responding to a query comprising:
maintaining a taxonomy that represents entities, categories to which the entities belong, and attributes for the categories; in response to receiving said query, performing the steps of:
identifying an attribute, from the taxonomy, that is specified in said query;
determining an external source from which to obtain the data;
obtaining data for the attribute from the external source; and
including said data for the attribute as search results for said query.
